<div id="q-docs-metadata" class="question">
  {# __tr_block_0000:start #}<h3>3. 資料將附有哪些後設資料與文件（例如資料蒐集方法與資料組織方式）？</h3>{# __tr_block_0000:end #}

  <div class="answer">
    {# __tr_block_0001:start #}<p>將發布的資料清單列於第 5 節第 10 題與第 11 題；其中也包含可找到資料的目錄資訊。使用的資料類型資訊列於第 1 節第 2 題。</p>{# __tr_block_0001:end #}{# Metadata #}{%- set metadataPath = [uuids.creatingCUuid, uuids.metadataQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataAUuid = repliesMap[metadataPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- if metadataAUuid == uuids.metadataExploreAUuid -%}{# Metadata standards #}{%- set metadataSentences = [] -%}{%- set metadataStandardsPath = [metadataPath, uuids.metadataExploreAUuid, uuids.metadataStandardsQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataStandardsAUuid = repliesMap[metadataStandardsPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- if metadataStandardsAUuid == uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDCPath = [metadataStandardsPath, uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid, uuids.metadataStandardsDCQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDCAUuid = repliesMap[metadataStandardsDCPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDataCityPath = [metadataStandardsPath, uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid, uuids.metadataStandardsDataCiteQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDataCityAUuid = repliesMap[metadataStandardsDataCityPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDDIPath = [metadataStandardsPath, uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid, uuids.metadataStandardsDDIQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataStandardsDDIAUuid = repliesMap[metadataStandardsDDIPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set metadataStandardsKeywordsPath = [metadataStandardsPath, uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid, uuids.metadataStandardsKeywordsQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set metadataStandardsKeywordsAUuid = repliesMap[metadataStandardsKeywordsPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set documentDataW3CPath = [metadataStandardsPath, uuids.metadataStandardsExploreAUuid, uuids.documentDataW3CQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set documentDataW3CAUuid = repliesMap[documentDataW3CPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set metadataStandards = [] -%}{%- if metadataStandardsDCAUuid == uuids.metadataStandardsDCYesAUuid -%}{# __tr_block_0002:start #}{%- do metadataStandards.append("Dublin Core") -%}{# __tr_block_0002:end #}{%- endif -%}{%- if metadataStandardsDataCityAUuid == uuids.metadataStandardsDataCiteYesAUuid -%}{# __tr_block_0003:start #}{%- do metadataStandards.append("DataCite") -%}{# __tr_block_0003:end #}{%- endif -%}{%- if metadataStandardsDDIAUuid == uuids.metadataStandardsDDIYesAUuid -%}{# __tr_block_0004:start #}{%- do metadataStandards.append("DDI（Data Documentation Initiative）") -%}{# __tr_block_0004:end #}{%- endif -%}{%- if metadataStandards|length == 1 -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:eyUtIGRvIG1ldGFkYXRhU2VudGVuY2VzLmFwcGVuZCgiV2Ugd2lsbCBiZSBkb2N1bWVudGluZyB0aGUgZGF0YSB3aXRoICIgfiBtZXRhZGF0YVN0YW5kYXJkc1swXSB-ICIgbWV0YWRhdGEgc3RhbmRhcmQuIikgLSV9 #}{%- set __tr_append_sentence_0000 -%}{# __tr_block_0005:start #}我們將使用 {{ metadataStandards[0] }} 後設資料標準記錄資料。{# __tr_block_0005:end #}{%- endset -%}{%- do metadataSentences.append(__tr_append_sentence_0000) -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:end -#}{%- elif metadataStandards|length == 2 -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:eyUtIGRvIG1ldGFkYXRhU2VudGVuY2VzLmFwcGVuZCgiV2Ugd2lsbCBiZSBkb2N1bWVudGluZyB0aGUgZGF0YSB3aXRoICIgfiBtZXRhZGF0YVN0YW5kYXJkc1swXSB-ICIgYW5kICIgfiBtZXRhZGF0YVN0YW5kYXJkc1sxXSB-ICIgbWV0YWRhdGEgc3RhbmRhcmRzLiIpIC0lfQ== #}{%- set __tr_append_sentence_0001 -%}{# __tr_block_0006:start #}我們將使用 {{ metadataStandards[0] }} 與 {{ metadataStandards[1] }} 後設資料標準記錄資料。{# __tr_block_0006:end #}{%- endset -%}{%- do metadataSentences.append(__tr_append_sentence_0001) -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:end -#}{%- elif metadataStandards|length == 3 -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:eyUtIGRvIG1ldGFkYXRhU2VudGVuY2VzLmFwcGVuZCgiV2Ugd2lsbCBiZSBkb2N1bWVudGluZyB0aGUgZGF0YSB3aXRoICIgfiBtZXRhZGF0YVN0YW5kYXJkc1swXSB-ICIsICIgfiBtZXRhZGF0YVN0YW5kYXJkc1sxXSB-ICIsIGFuZCAiIH4gbWV0YWRhdGFTdGFuZGFyZHNbMl0gfiAiIG1ldGFkYXRhIHN0YW5kYXJkcy4iKSAtJX0= #}{%- set __tr_append_sentence_0002 -%}{# __tr_block_0007:start #}我們將使用 {{ metadataStandards[0] }}、{{ metadataStandards[1] }} 與 {{ metadataStandards[2] }} 後設資料標準記錄資料。{# __tr_block_0007:end #}{%- endset -%}{%- do metadataSentences.append(__tr_append_sentence_0002) -%}{# __tr_append_sentence_original:end -#}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if metadataStandardsKeywordsAUuid == uuids.metadataStandardsKeywordsYesAUuid -%}{# __tr_block_0008:start #}
          {%- do metadataSentences.append("我們將納入關鍵字與相關本體參照，以提升資料探索與潛在再次使用的可能性。") -%}
        {# __tr_block_0008:end #}{%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- set provenanceW3CPath = [metadataPath, uuids.metadataExploreAUuid, uuids.provenanceW3CQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set provenanceW3CAUuid = repliesMap[provenanceW3CPath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if provenanceW3CAUuid == uuids.provenanceW3CYesAUuid -%}{# __tr_block_0009:start #}
          {%- do metadataSentences.append("資料溯源將以 W3C PROV 記錄。") -%}
      {# __tr_block_0009:end #}{%- endif -%}

      {%- if metadataSentences|length > 0 -%}
        <p>{{ metadataSentences|join("") }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {# Publishing metadata #}
    {%- set metadataOpenPath = [uuids.accessCUuid, uuids.metadataOpenQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set metadataOpenAUuid = repliesMap[metadataOpenPath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- if metadataOpenAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenNoAUuid %}
      {%- set explanation = repliesMap[[metadataOpenPath, metadataOpenAUuid, uuids.metadataOpenNoExplainQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if explanation -%}
        {# __tr_block_0010:start #}<p>Metadata will not be available openly &ndash; {{ explanation|e|dot }}</p>{# __tr_block_0010:end #}
      {%- else -%}
        {# __tr_block_0011:start #}<p>後設資料不會公開提供。</p>{# __tr_block_0011:end #}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elif metadataOpenAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenYesAUuid -%}
      {%- set metadataOpenInstrAUuid = repliesMap[[metadataOpenPath, metadataOpenAUuid, uuids.metadataOpenInstrQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- set metadataOpenFormAUuid = repliesMap[[metadataOpenPath, metadataOpenAUuid, uuids.metadataOpenFormQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
      {# __tr_block_0012:start #}<p>{%- if metadataOpenInstrAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenInstrNoAUuid %}後設資料將公開提供，並包含如何取用資料的說明。{%- elif metadataOpenInstrAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenInstrNoAUuid %}後設資料將公開提供，但不包含如何取用資料的說明。{%- else %}後設資料將公開提供。{%- endif %}{%- if metadataOpenFormAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenFormNoAUuid %}後設資料不會以可被擷取與索引的形式提供。{%- elif metadataOpenFormAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenFormYesRepoAUuid %}後設資料將以可被擷取與索引的形式提供（由所使用的資料儲存庫管理）。{%- elif metadataOpenFormAUuid == uuids.metadataOpenFormYesCareAUuid %}後設資料將以可被擷取與索引的形式提供。
      {%- endif %}
      </p>{# __tr_block_0012:end #}
    {%- endif -%}

  {# Storage and file conventions #}
  {%- set storageConvPath = [uuids.processingCUuid, uuids.storageConvQUuid]|reply_path -%}
  {%- set storageConvAUuid = repliesMap[storageConvPath]|reply_str_value -%}
  {%- if storageConvAUuid == uuids.storageConvExploreAUuid -%}
    {%- set stConvPrefix = [storageConvPath, uuids.storageConvExploreAUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set storageSpacePath = [stConvPrefix, uuids.storageSpaceQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set storageSpaceAUuid = repliesMap[storageSpacePath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- set storageConvFSysPath = [stConvPrefix, uuids.storageConvFSysQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set storageConvFSysAUuid = repliesMap[storageConvFSysPath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- set storageConvObjStorePath = [stConvPrefix, uuids.storageConvObjStoreQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set storageConvObjStoreAUuid = repliesMap[storageConvObjStorePath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- set storageConvRelDbPath = [stConvPrefix, uuids.storageConvRelDbQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set storageConvRelDbAUuid = repliesMap[storageConvRelDbPath]|reply_str_value -%}
    {%- if storageConvFSysAUuid or storageConvObjStoreAUuid or storageConvRelDbAUuid -%}
      {# __tr_block_0013:start #}<h4>資料儲存與檔案慣例</h4>{# __tr_block_0013:end #}
      {# Storage space #}
      {%- if storageSpaceAUuid == uuids.storageSpaceLittleAUuid -%}
        {# __tr_block_0014:start #}<p>本專案所有資料與軟體（包含暫存空間）所需的儲存空間很少，因此不會造成問題。</p>{# __tr_block_0014:end #}
      {%- elif storageSpaceAUuid == uuids.storageSpaceSpecifyAUuid -%}
        {%- set size = repliesMap[[storageSpacePath, storageSpaceAUuid, uuids.storageSpaceSpecifyQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- if size -%}
        {# __tr_block_0015:start #}<p>我們估計本專案所有資料與軟體（包含暫存空間）所需的儲存空間為 {{ size }} GB。</p>{# __tr_block_0015:end #}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {# File System #}
      {# __tr_branch_sentence_original:PHA----CiAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICBUaGVyZSB3aWxsIGJlICBhIDxzdHJvbmc---LgogICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgeyUgaWYgc2NGU3lzV29ya2Zsb3dTdGVwRm9sZGVyc0NvbnZzICV9CiAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgIEVhY2ggb2YgdGhvc2Ugd2lsbCB1c2UgdGhlIGZvbGxvd2luZyBjb252ZW50aW9uczoge3sgc2NGU3lzV29ya2Zsb3dTdGVwRm9sZGVyc0NvbnZzfGRvdCB9fQogICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgeyUtIGVuZGlmIC0lfQogICAgICAgICAgICAgIDwvbGk-CiAgICAgICAgICAgIHslLSBlbmRpZiAtJX0KICAgICAgICAgIDwvdWw- #}{# __tr_block_0016:start #}<p>{%- if storageConvFSysAUuid == uuids.storageConvFSysNoAUuid -%}我們不會使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統。{%- elif storageConvFSysAUuid == uuids.storageConvFSysYesAUuid -%}{%- set scFSysPrefix = [storageConvFSysPath, uuids.storageConvFSysYesAUuid]|reply_path -%}{# Folder types #}{%- set scFSysSubjFoldersPath = [scFSysPrefix, uuids.scFSysSubjFoldersQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set scFSysSubjFoldersAUuid = repliesMap[scFSysSubjFoldersPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set scFSysAnalysisFoldersPath = [scFSysPrefix, uuids.scFSysAnalysisFoldersQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set scFSysAnalysisFoldersAUuid = repliesMap[scFSysAnalysisFoldersPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersPath = [scFSysPrefix, uuids.scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersAUuid = repliesMap[scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- set subjectFolders = scFSysSubjFoldersAUuid == uuids.scFSysSubjFoldersYesAUuid -%}{%- set analysisFolders = scFSysAnalysisFoldersAUuid == uuids.scFSysAnalysisFoldersYesAUuid -%}{%- set workflowStepFolders = scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersAUuid == uuids.scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersYesAUuid -%}{%- set folders = [subjectFolders, analysisFolders, workflowStepFolders] -%}{%- if folders|any -%}我們將使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統，並採用以下資料夾慣例：
          <ul>
            {%- if subjectFolders -%}
              {%- set scFSysSubjFoldersConvs = repliesMap[[scFSysSubjFoldersPath, uuids.scFSysSubjFoldersYesAUuid, uuids.scFSysSubjFoldersConvsQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
              <li>
                每個樣本／研究對象都會有一個資料夾。
                {% if scFSysSubjFoldersConvs %}
                  Each of those will use the following conventions: {{ scFSysSubjFoldersConvs|dot }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if analysisFolders -%}
              {%- set scFSysAnalysisFoldersConvs = repliesMap[[scFSysAnalysisFoldersPath, uuids.scFSysAnalysisFoldersYesAUuid, uuids.scFSysAnalysisFoldersConvsQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
              <li>
                每一次（重複）分析都會有一個（子）資料夾。 
                {% if scFSysAnalysisFoldersConvs %}
                  Each of those will use the following conventions: {{ scFSysAnalysisFoldersConvs|dot }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if workflowStepFolders -%}
              {%- set scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersConvs = repliesMap[[scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersPath, uuids.scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersYesAUuid, uuids.scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersConvsQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value -%}
              <li>
                分析工作流程中的每個步驟都會有一個（子）資料夾。
                {% if scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersConvs %}
                  Each of those will use the following conventions: {{ scFSysWorkflowStepFoldersConvs|dot }}
                {%- endif -%}
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          </ul>{%- else -%}我們將使用以檔案與資料夾組成的檔案系統。{%- endif -%}{# Versioning #}{%- set scDocumentVersioningPath = [scFSysPrefix, uuids.scDocumentVersioningQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set scDocumentVersioningAUuid = repliesMap[scDocumentVersioningPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- if scDocumentVersioningAUuid == uuids.scDocumentVersioningYesAUuid %}我們會記錄如何管理檔案與資料夾的版本。
        {%- endif -%}
        {# Other appointments #}
        {%- set scFSysAppointmentsPath = [scFSysPrefix, uuids.scFSysAppointmentsQUuid]|reply_path -%}
        {%- set scFSysAppointments = repliesMap[scFSysAppointmentsPath]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- if scFSysAppointments %}{% if folders|any %}
          {# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgIk1vcmVvdmVyLCB3ZSIgaWYgZm9sZGVyc3xhbnkgZWxzZSAiV2UiIH19 #}{{ "Moreover, we" }}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #} have made appointments about naming the files. {{ appointmentsText|capitalize|dot }}
        {% else %}
          {# __tr_inline_if_original:e3sgIk1vcmVvdmVyLCB3ZSIgaWYgZm9sZGVyc3xhbnkgZWxzZSAiV2UiIH19 #}{{ "We" }}{# __tr_inline_if_original:end #} have made appointments about naming the files. {{ appointmentsText|capitalize|dot }}
        {% endif %}{%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      </p>{# __tr_block_0016:end #}{# __tr_branch_sentence_original:end #}
      {# Object and Document Store #}
      {# __tr_block_0017:start #}<p>{%- if storageConvObjStoreAUuid == uuids.storageConvObjStoreNoAUuid -%}我們不會將資料儲存在「物件／文件儲存」系統中。
      {%- elif storageConvObjStoreAUuid == uuids.storageConvObjStoreYesAUuid -%}
        {%- set scObjStoreNamingQUuid = [storageConvObjStorePath, uuids.storageConvObjStoreYesAUuid, uuids.scObjStoreNamingQUuid]|reply_path -%}
        {%- set scObjStoreNaming = repliesMap[scObjStoreNamingQUuid]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- if scObjStoreNaming -%} 
          We will be storing data in an "object/document store" system using following naming conventions for objects in the store: {{ scObjStoreNaming|dot }}{%- else -%}我們將把資料儲存在「物件／文件儲存」系統中。
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      </p>{# __tr_block_0017:end #}
      {# Databases #}
      {# __tr_block_0018:start #}<p>{%- if storageConvRelDbAUuid == uuids.storageConvRelDbNoAUuid -%}我們不會使用資料庫系統儲存專案資料。{%- elif storageConvRelDbAUuid == uuids.storageConvRelDbYesAUuid -%}我們將使用資料庫系統儲存專案資料。{%- set scRelDbHandleChangesPath = [storageConvRelDbPath, uuids.storageConvRelDbYesAUuid, uuids.scRelDbHandleChangesQUuid]|reply_path -%}{%- set scRelDbHandleChangesAUuid = repliesMap[scRelDbHandleChangesPath]|reply_str_value -%}{%- if scRelDbHandleChangesAUuid == uuids.scRelDbReadOnlyAnswerUuid %}資料庫中的資料將為唯讀。{%- elif scRelDbHandleChangesAUuid == uuids.scRelDbCrudAnswerUuid %}我們將允許對資料庫中的資料進行建立、更新與刪除操作。{%- elif scRelDbHandleChangesAUuid == uuids.scRelDbExpireAnswerUuid %}修改將透過使既有資料失效並新增更新後資料的方式進行。
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      </p>{# __tr_block_0018:end #}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>
